From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 21:34:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 31/39] s13d g4 cont4: the guarded passes and the home move,
 composed as the found path

The rightward cascade's four side passes (the descending passes on the right and the left, the
ascending passes with their returns), the walk out, the guarded home move and the single pop,
each a pinned segment, and their composition from the scanned zone's field to the home with
track t cascaded at the scanned index. The shared descending-pass lemmas move ahead of the
first pass; zr_PinStep_exits replaces zr_PinStep_single; the left shift's length lemmas cite
zr_lfields.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0155fKrzMUhziJHzQxJacYbw
